  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Bring\n• a medium saucepan of salted water to the boil.\n• Finely chop the garlic. Cut the zucchini into bite-sized chunks. Thinly slice the capsicum. Slice the\n• red onion into wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/605a5cd8ad902c14763a7fea/step-f47253ea.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread the zucchini, capsicum, cherry tomatoes,\n• onion and garlic & herb seasoning on a lined\n• baking tray. Drizzle with olive oil and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/605a5cd8ad902c14763a7fea/step-fc6946cd.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the veggies are roasting, cook the farfalle\n• in boiling water until 'al dente',\n• 11 minutes. Reserve some pasta water (1/4 cup\n• for 2 people / 1/2 cup for 4 people), then drain and\n• return the pasta to the saucepan. Drizzle with a\n• little olive oil to prevent the pasta from sticking\n• together.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/605a5cd8ad902c14763a7fea/step-d65f80b8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the veggies have 5 minutes left, heat a large frying pan over a medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Add the garlic and cook, until fragrant,\n• 1 minute. Add the passata and reserved pasta\n• water and cook, until slightly reduced,\n• 2-3 minutes. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/605a5cd8ad902c14763a7fea/step-83e6c2f9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop the semi-dried tomatoes. Add\n• the farfalle, roasted veggies and semi-dried\n• tomatoes into the pan. Stir to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/605a5cd8ad902c14763a7fea/step-59b1cd8d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the cherry tomato farfalle between bowls.\n• Top with the fetta cubes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/605a5cd8ad902c14763a7fea/step-0fca8186.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
